muSqIfF8At8Q7kNvwHbAqz1&_nc_oc=AdrDGIYLGeU2lyqXxOcNhcCW8r6CQAW_vkiFxfNKJtArhtUnyZMb8htacXW0aUEuERs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5XK5jkTKrNbOuYw5AnsRoyMMJDfs8BYzbUqP6O59yRHA&oe=6A1307B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zxGJGRUspX0Q7kNvwEYEFL7&_nc_oc=AdpZ1NqXUy83NqTRQKADdtHfmyNCEY8EmvUsVbh0ToU_0hzgiExzoBHZh6dhojjbGec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6M2KKiKgz2kkHbZpf99nSNOuhRnVjwCwP5DNVoN4xypQ&oe=6A13094A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bs4dHSqG4xsQ7kNvwGPszEv&_nc_oc=AdpEZnavDhUEErUtMMrn1iuw5JzihVoTjzN-9Us7YmrgT7XbrJLxKIuFd80zJJzody0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5pL_POUkEy-8huYR8bDDasx3cyx6EQ6r1vvEubN2h53g&oe=6A12F66F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vQFwkzWtDiAQ7kNvwHffprz&_nc_oc=Ado2MJBit-kk8d1Ettvz7Gvq5hFaPBSOwugnFkU0Pg-SqvebThHArNlOnAhJ-NUI_OA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af49c_yaG7mRSif9UMasyuU2rsFi3SF1-Ip3nEDhpK2Sfw&oe=6A131803"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LCt904DN_CAQ7kNvwGbbEVt&_nc_oc=Adq-dxMPZP-ex2PpGYhPZL2SIpwBYG3DreVunAHFVHBmwz-Uv7qkNVL56XaAq6ZRISY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5KIXYnMhCpVHZQUpHWydN3Kd_po9IKiUYD5T30Gmzk_g&oe=6A131058"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZAtlI4Dfem8Q7kNvwFTbAIb&_nc_oc=AdrktQlvQP0qQSZmIfg6fvG92Dqzpz46PIX_fsoLlNOFkZ2UdVf090s99iPs1qG_dKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Mlu35QwRhg1aWTlZ7ZJAmDYsgb9zaTECjBzYvX-s_hg&oe=6A12EB3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080